        <item>
            <title>Version 0.1.5</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 17 Jul 2026 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
            <description>Fixes automatic updates, which downloaded the new version but never installed it. Note: this fix lives in the updater itself, so it takes effect from this version onwards — if you are on 0.1.4 or earlier you will need to install this update manually one time.</description>
