        <item>
            <title>Version 0.1.4</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 17 Jul 2026 09:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
            <description>Collections no longer stop at 240 images — large collections now sync completely. Adds a Multiple displays mode (a different image per monitor, or one image mirrored across all of them), a 1000-image cache limit option, and a Next button when Display order is By Name or By Date Created.</description>
            <enclosure
                url="https://github.com/yogiee/WallP/releases/download/windows-v0.1.4/WallP-0.1.4.zip"
